<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title><%= h(snapshot.dig("project", "title")) %> — PoC Flight Deck</title>
<style>
.scroll table{min-width:540px}
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#07111e;--panel:#102235;--line:#28445c;--text:#edf4fb;--muted:#b5c7da;--accent:#69d9b2}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;padding:20px}header,section,.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:16px}h1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.2rem;margin:0 0 12px}h3{font-size:1rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{margin:8px 0}.meta,.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.card{margin:0;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.posture{font-weight:700;color:var(--text)}.stage{font-size:.8rem;margin:6px 0}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.row>div{min-width:0}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.9rem}td,th{padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.scroll{overflow:auto}a{color:#9bd7ff}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}details{margin:10px 0}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}@media(max-width:1000px){.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:600px){main{padding:10px}.cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}header,section{padding:12px}h1{font-size:1.25rem}}@media(max-width:360px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><main>
<header><h1><%= h(snapshot.dig("project", "title")) %> — Executive Flight Deck</h1><p><%= h(snapshot.dig("project", "objective")) %></p><p class="meta">Rendered: <%= snapshot.fetch("rendered_at") %> · Source: <%= h(snapshot.dig("source", "source_state_timestamp")) %> · <%= h(source_identity) %> · Scope: <%= h(snapshot.fetch("scope_version")) %></p></header>
<section id="executive"><h2>Completion posture</h2><p class="posture"><%= h(poc_estimate(snapshot.fetch("summary"))) %></p><p><%= h(poc_counts(snapshot.fetch("summary"))) %></p><p class="note"><%= snapshot.dig("summary", "requirement_count") %> unique active requirements. Unknown evidence is not a pass. Implementation, recorded verification and recorded acceptance are separate; no release authority is conferred.</p>
<h2>Major elements</h2><div class="cards"><% snapshot.fetch("elements").each do |element| -%><article class="card"><h3><%= h(element.fetch("title")) %></h3><p class="posture"><%= h(poc_estimate(element.fetch("summary"))) %></p><% %w[implementation verification acceptance].each do |stage| count=element.dig("summary",stage) -%><p class="stage"><%= stage.capitalize %>: <%= count.fetch("complete") %>/<%= count.fetch("applicable") %> complete; <%= count.fetch("unknown") %> unknown</p><% end -%></article><% end -%></div>
<div class="row"><div><h3>Leadership attention</h3><% attention=snapshot.fetch("attention").select{|row|row.fetch("state")=="ACTIONABLE_NOW"} -%><% if attention.empty? -%><p>No currently actionable decision recorded.</p><% end -%><% attention.each do |row| -%><p><%= h(row.fetch("question")) %> — <%= h(row.fetch("owner")) %></p><% end -%></div><div><h3>Current blockers</h3><% if snapshot.fetch("blockers").empty? -%><p>No active blocker recorded; missing evidence remains unknown.</p><% end -%><% snapshot.fetch("blockers").each do |row| -%><p><%= h(row.fetch("title")) %></p><% end -%></div><div><h3>Next recommended action</h3><p><%= h(snapshot.fetch("recommended_action")) %></p></div></div><h3>Movement</h3><p><%= h(snapshot.dig("movement","status")) %> — <%= h(snapshot.dig("movement","note")) %></p></section>
<section id="readiness"><h2>PoC Readiness</h2><p class="meta">Rendered: <%= snapshot.fetch("rendered_at") %> · <%= h(source_identity) %></p><h3>Dependency-ordered capabilities</h3><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Capability</th><th>Dependencies</th><th>Requirements</th><th>Posture</th></tr></thead><tbody><% snapshot.fetch("capabilities").each do |row| -%><tr><td><%= h(row.fetch("title")) %></td><td><%= h(row.fetch("dependencies").join(", ")) %></td><td><%= h(row.fetch("requirement_ids").join(", ")) %></td><td><%= h(poc_estimate(row.fetch("summary"))) %><br><%= h(poc_counts(row.fetch("summary"))) %></td></tr><% end -%></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Native requirement drilldown</summary><div class="scroll"><table><tr><th>Requirement</th><th>Scope</th><th>Implementation</th><th>Verification</th><th>Acceptance</th></tr><% snapshot.fetch("requirements").each do |row| -%><tr><td><%= h(row.fetch("id")) %> — <%= h(row.fetch("title")) %></td><td><%= h(row.fetch("scope_state")) %></td><% %w[implementation verification acceptance].each do |stage| value=row.dig("lifecycle",stage) -%><td><%= h(value.fetch("status")) %> <%= h(value["result"]) %></td><% end -%></tr><% end -%></table></div></details></section>
<section id="manager"><h2>Manager detail</h2><p class="meta">Rendered: <%= snapshot.fetch("rendered_at") %> · <%= h(source_identity) %></p><% snapshot.fetch("gaps").each do |row| -%><p><a href="<%= h(poc_reference(row.fetch("reference"))) %>"><%= h(row.fetch("title")) %></a> — <%= h(row.fetch("state")) %></p><% end -%><% snapshot.fetch("attention").each do |row| -%><p><a href="<%= h(poc_reference(row.fetch("reference"))) %>"><%= h(row.fetch("question")) %></a> — <%= h(row.fetch("state")) %></p><% end -%><ul><% snapshot.fetch("diagnostics").each do |item| -%><li><%= h(item) %></li><% end -%></ul></section>
<section id="engineering"><h2>Engineering provenance</h2><p class="meta">Rendered: <%= snapshot.fetch("rendered_at") %> · Source: <%= h(snapshot.dig("source","source_state_timestamp")) %> · <%= h(source_identity) %></p><p>Mechanism <%= h(snapshot.fetch("mechanism_version")) %> · Policy <%= h(snapshot.fetch("policy_version")) %> · Source <code><%= h(snapshot.dig("source","commit")) %></code></p><details><summary>Source hashes</summary><div class="scroll"><table><tr><th>Project-relative source</th><th>SHA-256</th></tr><% snapshot.dig("source","hashes").each do |path,digest| -%><tr><td><%= h(path) %></td><td><code><%= h(digest) %></code></td></tr><% end -%></table></div></details><h3>Declared references and limits</h3><p class="note">A link alone is not an interpreted result. Narrative, unavailable and inapplicable evidence remains UNKNOWN.</p><ul><% snapshot.fetch("requirements").each do |row| -%><% row.fetch("evidence_refs").each do |reference| -%><li><%= h(row.fetch("id")) %>: <a href="<%= h(poc_reference(reference)) %>"><%= h(reference) %></a> — declared reference, not itself verification or acceptance.</li><% end -%><% end -%></ul><details><summary>Recorded evidence and limits</summary><% snapshot.fetch("requirements").each do |row| -%><% %w[verification acceptance].each do |stage| -%><% row.dig("lifecycle",stage,"evidence").each do |record| -%><p><%= h(row.fetch("id")) %> / <%= stage %>: <a href="<%= h(poc_reference(record.fetch("reference"))) %>"><%= h(record.fetch("reference")) %></a> · Original source <code><%= h(record.fetch("source_revision")) %></code> · Executed <%= h(record.fetch("executed_at")) %></p><% end -%><% end -%><% end -%><p>Human decision coordinates are recorded references, not independently authenticated approval or new gate authority. Narrative evidence stays linked with its limits. Working inputs are not relabeled as executed commits.</p></details></section>
<footer class="note">On-demand local derived view. No credentials, application startup, network refresh, work dispatch or acceptance action.</footer></main></body></html>
